  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (see attached schedule) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The resdiential units hereby approved shall comply with Lifetime home standards.",
    "Condition : 4 - The residential units hereby approved shall not be ocupied until details of post test completion testing of the internal noise enviornment have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authoirty. The details shall demonstrate that an acceptable.scheme of acoustic insulation and any associated ventilation to ensure the maximum noise level to be permitted within dwellings with windows shut and any other necessary means of ventilation provided shall not exceed the \"good\" limits contained in BS8233:1999. These being LAeq,16hour = 30 dB in living rooms, and a night(07:00\r\n- 23:00) LAeq,8hour = 30 dB and LAFmax = 45 dB in bedrooms, and a night LAeq,lhour = 45 dB in Kitchens, Bathrooms and Utility Rooms\". The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 5 - No residential occupation shall take place until Post Construction Stage Assessment of\r\ndwellings shows meeting the predicted pre-assessment level of Code for Sustainable Homes, or level 3 as a minimum, and details have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority (Post Construction Stage Assessment)"
  ],
